:: Widgets Sam [widget]
<<widget "SamOptions">>
	<<if !_no_options>>
		<<if (Time.hour is 6 and Time.minute gte 55) or (Time.dayState is "dawn" and Time.hour gt 6)>>
			/* (Time.weekDay gte 2 and Time.weekDay lte 6 and (Time.hour is 15 and Time.minute gte 55) or Time.hour gt 15) */ /*Addition block of condition if Sam ever take a break from the cafe at 3pm to 4pm */
			<<if $chef_rework gt 0 or $chef_state is 7 or $chef_state is 8>>
				"I better head off," Sam says. "Still a lot of work to do <<if $chef_state is 8>>for the Cafe reopening.<<else>>even with the Cafe under construction.<</if>> I'll see you later!"
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Say goodbye|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
			<<else>>
				"I better head off," Sam says. "I don't want to be late for work."
				<br><br>

				<<link [[Say goodbye|Park]]>><<endevent>><<set $eventskip to 1>><</link>>
				<br>
				<<link [[Ask to walk with <<him>>|Sam Walk Cafe]]>><</link>>
			<</if>>
		<<else>>
			<<nnpc_He "Sam">> gives you a friendly smile.
			<br><br>

			<<socialiseicon>><<link [[Talk with Sam (0:15)|Sam Park Talk]]>><<npcincr Sam love 1>><<pass 15>><<endevent>><</link>><<glove>>
			<br>
			<<walkicon>><<link [[Ask to go for a walk (0:15)|Sam Park Walk]]>><<pass 15>><<set $daily.sam_walk to true>><<npcincr Sam love 1>><<endevent>><<stress -3>><</link>><<lstress>><<glove>>
			<br>
			<<animalicon "duck">><<link [[Feed the ducks (0:10)|Sam Park Duck]]>><<pass 10>><<set $daily.sam_duck to true>><<npcincr Sam love 1>><<tending 2>><<endevent>><</link>><<glove>><<gtending>>
			<br>
			<<getouticon>><<link [[Leave|Park]]>><<endevent>><</link>>
		<</if>>
	<</if>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "sam_loft">>
	<<set _no_options to true>>
	<<set $samSeen.pushUnique("gift")>>
	You're in the middle of a conversation when you notice Sam looking at you curiously.
		<br><br>
		<<if $speech_attitude is "meek">>
			"What's wrong Sam?" You ask <<him>>.
		<<elseif $speech_attitude is "bratty">>
			"Hey speak up, why are you staring at me?" you ask.
		<<else>>
			"What's up?" you ask. "Do I have something on my face?"
		<</if>>
		<br><br>
		"You caught me!" <<he>> smiles at you. "I was just thinking how you've come over to spend time with an old crony like me. I can't help but feel a bit touched! I'm sure the little duckies here feel the same way."
		<br><br>

		<<link [[Next|Sam Loft]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>
